Tehuti is licensed per part, as decided in docs/adr/0004-licensing.md.
The full texts are in LICENSES/.

MPL-2.0 (LICENSES/MPL-2.0.txt):
  crates/core, crates/compositor, fuzz, sidecars, dist, scripts, tests,
  and the docs that describe them (README.md, docs/ except as listed below).

Apache-2.0 (LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt):
  crates/protocol, docs/protocol, docs/contexts.md, and the top-level examples/ directory.
  Example programs inside a crate (such as crates/compositor/examples/)
  follow their crate's licence.

The bundled Liberation fonts keep their own licence:
  crates/compositor/assets/Liberation-LICENSE

Third-party plugins are separate programs and may use any licence.
